        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kikunyut adwe nuka Selopekad, okoku loka Keper, okoku loka Gilead, okoku loka Makir, okoku loka Manase, nuka ikekia luka Manase, okoku loka Yosep: lu kes ikiroria luka adweke; Mala, ka Noa, ka Kogila, ka Milika, ka Tirusa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
