            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koyau Musa akeeekirot mama ejai EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema EJAKAIT Musa atiar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.36.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 36:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ineras adwe nuka Selopekad nuedolito: abeit iinakini kes airumet koinaean luka papakee; ido itebei airumet naka papakee mamakee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilimokini idwe luka Isirael ebe, ‘Arai ketwana etuŋanan, komamei ikoku yenisapat, itebei do airumeteke mama ejai akokuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arai emamei ŋes akokuke; iinakini airumeteke mama ejaas iinaeanake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arai emameete ŋes iinacanake, iinakini do airumeteke mama ejaas iinaean luka papake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 35:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arai emameete papake iinaean, iinakini akeirumet mama ejai opajanake loka ekekike, ŋesi da irumi: eraun kama ejaas idwe luka Isirael ekisil loka etube, kwape kieorakinia EJAKAIT Musa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
