          "text": " Ebwoi kakonyen nuka Eleasar esasedoti, loinitununei kanuke kotube loka Urim kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: kakirotoke elomariata, kakirotoke da elomuniata, ŋes ka idwe kere luka Isirael nepepe kaŋes, ekodet kere.” ",
